--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 983baf44e5cdb194583b1c23ada50e41, type: 3}
  m_Name: Boss
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Exceptional... truly. We are so close now, aren't we?
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e687e81657964b46b46b6528f5e211e, type: 3}
    answers: []
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Just one more, just one final interaction... and our masterpiece
      will finally be whole.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cc9e3d824bd9e243b206511e79a8ca2, type: 3}
    answers: []
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: I hope you realize how vital you are to this process. You aren't
      just an employee..
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c50d687fa8e112c4cb74d623ca60e48f, type: 3}
    answers: []
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: It is your specific... resonance... that brings them to life. You
      are the only constant in this entire collection. Without you, they are just...
      plastic and dust.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d8b6b730fe77b6489a6e713a4366be8, type: 3}
    answers: []
  - speakerName: BOSS
    dialogueText: Now... let us complete the test with <color=red>the final doll</color>,
      hmph.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b4d418032adf47d46aa21229345da5a5, type: 3}
    answers: []
